  "translation": "A ye ⟨את⟩ Yisrayɛl (Isirayɛl) ka dannu lase, min bɛ Hamat ka don yɔrɔ la, ka se Araba kɔgɔji ma, i n'a fɔ Yawe, Yisrayɛl ka Ala, ka kuma min fɔra a ka sansan Yonah (Yunusa), Amitay denkɛ, nabi in fɛ, min bɛ Gat-Hefɛr (Gat-Hefɛr) na, kuma kɔnɔ.",
